{"c":[{"id":"921a29be1c45a6be","sum":"Leaf identity is content: leafset_id keys the multiset, leaf_digests the set. Heal dropping a packed-text loose note is the #77 shoebox. Theory names the system; the leak may name those two functions. Do not cite notes.md for that judgement.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T211122Z-ad3d3bf48d2c3470","text":"Leaf identity is content-only: heal drops a loose note whose text already sits inside a pack, silently deleting a just-written note (#77). leafset_id keys on the multiset; leaf_digests keys on the set.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T214451Z-1d8350664f6c3f7d","text":"theory.md argues why it converges: name the system, not summem:line. Architecture owns filenames and functions. Exception: the #77 leak names leafset_id vs leaf_digests because that disagreement is the defect. Do not cite notes.md from 'leaving the cut open is a judgement'.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"20725fd9d9689622","sum":"Leaf identity is content (L is a set of facts), not per-file name+bytes; heal dropping a packed-text loose note is the #77 shoebox, intended, not a bug.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T220028Z-01040c6fdd23aa89","text":"Leaf identity is per-file (name + bytes); two recordings of one sentence are two leaves (#77)","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T220314Z-0fd6a303482b711a","text":"L is a set of facts (content); heal dropping a packed-text loose note is the shoebox, not a bug. #77 trigger 1 is intended.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
